---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Security — HWcontrol Team" description="Security engineering principles of HWcontrol Team." active="security">
  <section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Trust & security</span><h1>Security is a lifecycle.</h1><p class="lead">Least privilege, dependency analysis, secure CI/CD, release integrity and privacy-preserving diagnostics are treated as engineering requirements.</p></div></section>
  <section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Least privilege</h2><p>Workflows request only the permissions required for their job.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Supply chain</h2><p>Dependencies and GitHub Actions are reviewed and pinned where appropriate.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Privacy</h2><p>Diagnostics are local-first, consent-based and sanitized before transmission.</p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
